{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sojourn Past is a fast-paced, bullet-hell inspired action-adventure game. Dash, slash, and teleport your way through challenging enemies and difficult bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious world where a story of loss and healing unfolds through discovery, visual storytelling and emotional soundtracks. Your journey isn\u2019t just about survival, but a search for healing and endurance.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFICULT ENEMIES AND BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/0b8a88aed502ade0ebb543aef4f06d43.poster.avif?t=1769764925\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/0b8a88aed502ade0ebb543aef4f06d43.webm?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/0b8a88aed502ade0ebb543aef4f06d43.mp4?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, skill-based combat against challenging enemies and difficult bosses that will test your reflexes and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BULLET-HELL INSPIRED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/68c9c8d98311a87d4a410945ff577420.poster.avif?t=1769764925\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/68c9c8d98311a87d4a410945ff577420.webm?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/68c9c8d98311a87d4a410945ff577420.mp4?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, dodge, and fight your way through intense bullet-hell challenges that test your reflexes and precision at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/3917b791642caa7734a9cb7fcff35005.poster.avif?t=1769764925\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/3917b791642caa7734a9cb7fcff35005.webm?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/3917b791642caa7734a9cb7fcff35005.mp4?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master abilities like the teleportation dagger to break through enemy lines, escape danger, or reach places hidden from plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDDEN SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/72e7cf7534a9d63c3508837156e66c2c.poster.avif?t=1769764925\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/72e7cf7534a9d63c3508837156e66c2c.webm?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/72e7cf7534a9d63c3508837156e66c2c.mp4?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden pathways and uncover secrets tucked away in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > INTERACT WITH THE WORLD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/f453435ee0055c5f7ce7ff453fe71507.poster.avif?t=1769764925\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/f453435ee0055c5f7ce7ff453fe71507.webm?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/f453435ee0055c5f7ce7ff453fe71507.mp4?t=1769764925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the world, discover and interact with your surroundings to reveal what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1769764925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1769764925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/8f4fc681c1053c8d155b324ab69f8a094071fe78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769764925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/8f4fc681c1053c8d155b324ab69f8a094071fe78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769764925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW SOJOURN PAST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/287629